      "author_handle": "tzautxi",
      "created_at": "2026-05-06T18:21:45Z",
      "text": "@ChGefaell 🔴2⃣30.000 BL=RNT - 2000 - 1034❌\n              60, 90,  120 BL = RNT - 2000✅\n🔴3⃣ IRPF = BL sometida a gravamen -  MP sometido a gravamen.\n🔴4⃣cuota de  solidaridad 2025, en 2026 se incrementa la BMC a 61.214,40",
      "links": [],
